Description
Manage installed data sources (Python and .NET plugins)

Usage: musoq data-sources <command>

Commands
  create         Create a new Python data source from a template
  folder         Show or open the data sources folder
  import         Import a data source from a local path or zip file
  install        Install a data source from the plugin registry
  list           List all installed data sources
  search         Search for data sources in the GitHub registry
  set-source     Set the installation source for a data source
  show           Show detailed information about a specific data source
  uninstall      Uninstall a data source
  uninstall-all  Uninstall all installed data sources
  update         Update installed data sources from their registries
